---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const posts = (await getCollection('blog', ({ data }) => !data.draft))
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.publishedAt.valueOf() - a.data.publishedAt.valueOf())
  .slice(0, 3);
---
<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="eyebrow">FactoryOps AI · Build · Learn · Record</div>
    <h1>제조 현장 문제를<br />Agentic AI로 풀어갑니다.</h1>
    <p class="lead">FactoryOps AI를 직접 구현하며 FastAPI, 검색, RAG, Tool Calling, Agent Orchestration, MCP까지 단계적으로 확장하는 과정을 기록합니다.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button primary" href={`${base}blog/`}>개발 기록 보기</a>
      <a class="button" href={`${base}projects/`}>FactoryOps AI 보기</a>
      <a class="button" href="https://github.com/jaedark/factoryops-ai" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub 소스</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Latest Engineering Notes</div><h2>최근 개발 기록</h2></div></div>
    <div class="grid">
      {posts.map((post) => (
        <a class="card" href={`${base}blog/${post.id}/`}>
          <div class="meta">{post.data.publishedAt.toLocaleDateString('ko-KR')}</div>
          <h3>{post.data.title}</h3>
          <p>{post.data.description}</p>
          <div class="tags">{post.data.tags.map((tag) => <span class="tag">{tag}</span>)}</div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <div class="eyebrow">Project Roadmap</div>
    <h2>이 프로젝트에서 검증할 것</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card"><h3>1. Backend & Retrieval</h3><p>FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, Keyword Search, Vector Search를 직접 구현하며 검색 기반을 만듭니다.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">FastAPI</span><span class="tag">SQLAlchemy</span><span class="tag">Vector Search</span></div></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>2. RAG & Tool Calling</h3><p>검색 결과를 LLM 응답으로 연결하고, 필요한 기능을 Tool로 분리해 실제 업무 흐름을 만듭니다.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">RAG</span><span class="tag">LLM</span><span class="tag">Tool Calling</span></div></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>3. Agentic AI & MCP</h3><p>Agent Orchestration과 MCP를 통해 장애 분석, 지식 조회, 대응 추천, 보고서 생성을 연결합니다.</p><div class="tags"><span class="tag">Agent</span><span class="tag">Orchestration</span><span class="tag">MCP</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
